  "summary": "Canonical ruv context URI parsing, capability-governed context namespace and immutable RVF revisions. Compile exact non-executable context bytes into self-verified RVF artifacts with SHA-256 identity. Boundaries: Discovery metadata grants no authority and cannot execute. Native compiler and Rust tests not yet run in this session.",
